<title>USA: CTS Corp raises tender offer for Dynamics.</title>
<headline>CTS Corp raises tender offer for Dynamics.</headline>
<dateline>ELKHART, Ind. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>CTS Corp said Monday it has increased its tender offer for about 50 percent of the common stock of Dynamics Corp of America to $56.25 a share.</p>
<p>Diversified manufacturer CTS has previously offered $55 a share in cash and stock for electrical housewares and industrial equipment maker Dynamics Corp. But last week, WHX Corp said its SB Acquisition Corp unit had increased its cash offer for Dynamics Corp to $56 from $45.</p>
</text>
